WEBVTT

1
00:00:05,140 --> 00:00:08,140
My surname is Gao. I work in the purchasing department of the machinery factory of Gao Jianshe.

2
00:00:08,140 --> 00:00:10,940
The factory is big, there are many workers, and there are many leaders

3
00:00:10,940 --> 00:00:12,940
Sometimes you need something good to improve your food

4
00:00:12,940 --> 00:00:14,940
You're on the right track

5
00:00:14,940 --> 00:00:17,080
The price is negotiable

6
00:00:17,080 --> 00:00:19,080
The amount is not ten or eight pounds.

7
00:00:19,080 --> 00:00:21,800
How many do I want?

8
00:00:21,800 --> 00:00:25,300
As long as the products from Kitushan are good, I will accept them.

9
00:00:25,300 --> 00:00:26,830
Cash payment

10
00:00:26,830 --> 00:00:30,030
The purchasing department of the machinery factory is a good line

11
00:00:30,030 --> 00:00:34,060
It will make shipping more convenient and safer after using it

12
00:00:34,060 --> 00:00:38,700
Not much left now

13
00:00:38,900 --> 00:00:46,710
How can I find you when I have goods in the future?

14
00:00:46,710 --> 00:00:48,710
Every Tuesday and Thursday afternoon

15
00:00:48,710 --> 00:00:50,310
I'm usually in the office

16
00:00:50,310 --> 00:00:57,160
You can also find me at this address for cleaning

17
00:00:57,160 --> 00:00:59,960
When it’s in stock, I’ll contact you. Feel free.
